## Why This Is Asked
Tests mastery of advanced CSS layout concepts (container queries, grid masonry concepts, and motion accessibility) without JS.

## Key Concepts
- CSS Grid with grid-column: span and grid-auto-flow: dense
- Container Queries to adapt column count by parent size
- CSS Custom Properties for density toggling
- Accessible motion: respects prefers-reduced-motion

